 surface consists of lobulated tan yellow fat with a scant amount of interspersed gray white fibrous tissue  No other masses or lesions are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of cavity to nearest margins  with section to skin scar in block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue away from cavity  Received fresh  labeled  additional right mastectomy flap   is a 9 5cm in diameter rim of white  wrinkled skin excised to a depth of 0 6cm  There are no masses or lesions identified on the skin surface  The margins are inked black  and representative sections are submitted in blocks  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART B  Skin  Additional Right Mastectomy Flap   Excision  report_end  , Not Done.
